@startuml
[*] --> ViewOwnTasks
ViewOwnTasks --> UpdateOwnTasks : Update own tasks
UpdateOwnTasks --> ViewOwnTasks : Return to view own tasks
ViewOwnTasks --> ViewOthersTasks : View others' tasks
ViewOthersTasks --> CoordinateTasks : Coordinate tasks
CoordinateTasks --> ViewOthersTasks : Continue viewing others' tasks
CoordinateTasks --> UpdateOwnTasks : Update own tasks
ViewOthersTasks --> ReceiveUpdates : Receive updates
ReceiveUpdates --> ViewOthersTasks : Continue viewing others' tasks
ReceiveUpdates --> [*] : Finish
@enduml
